1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,380
The disc wins.

2
00:00:01,380 --> 00:00:02,695
Every single time.

3
00:00:02,695 --> 00:00:06,601
Not because it is heavier, and not because it is smaller.

4
00:00:06,601 --> 00:00:08,893
Same mass, same size.

5
00:00:08,893 --> 00:00:13,255
The secret is how the mass is arranged around the axis of spin.

6
00:00:13,255 --> 00:00:17,617
By the end of this lesson, you will be able to prove exactly why.

